data: {"id": "c06dde780d1248a2-thinking-parallel_evidence-2832", "run_id": "c06dde780d1248a2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Let me analyze the evidence collected for the Pod `aiops-case-v17/workload`.\n\n## 1. Entity Identity & Lifecycle\n\n- **Pod**: `workload` in namespace `aiops-case-v17`\n- **Pod UID**: `85aece07-6ffa-41db-9e5a-f351771a8864`\n- **Node**: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.36`\n- **Container**: `app` (image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)\n- **Phase**: Running (kubectl_get_yaml confirms)\n- **Creation**: `2026-09-14T13:05:55Z`\n\n## 2. Current Anomaly Status: CrashLoopBackOff", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789397193187, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

